      "summary_en": "Leona raises her shield to gain Damage Reduction, Armor, and Magic Resist. When the duration first ends, if there are nearby enemies, she will deal magic damage to them and prolong the duration of the effect.",
      "summary_zh": "蕾欧娜举起盾牌，提供伤害减免、护甲和魔法抗性。当持续时间首次结束时，如果附近有敌人，那么她会对其造成魔法伤害并延长效果的持续时间。",
